weekNN_*/papers/
    Research papers redistributed for convenience. Each remains under its own
    copyright, held by its authors and publishers (ACM, PMLR, arXiv authors,
    and the respective institutions). They are author copies and preprints
    collected from publicly accessible sources; every URL is recorded in
    tools/fetch_papers.py so any file can be traced to its origin and removed.

    If you are an author or rights-holder and would prefer a paper not be
    mirrored here, open an issue and it will be deleted — tools/fetch_papers.py
    will still fetch it on demand for anyone who runs `make papers`.

    The Attribution Reporting API documents (week10_privacy/papers/*.md) come
    from the W3C WICG attribution-reporting-api repository and carry that
    project's own licence.

data/
    Not distributed in this repository. The Criteo datasets are downloaded by
    tools/fetch_datasets.py from Criteo's official Hugging Face org and are
    governed by Criteo's own terms of use, which you accept by downloading
    them. Nothing in data/ is committed here.
